	(text "PB6 may carry a UCPD dead-battery pull-down at reset (PA9 = DBCC1 is pulled high); I2C_DUT_EN has an external pull-down anyway. Same for PB4 (CC2): PA10 = DBCC2 is held low by the 100k on RANGE_CLK_5VSW; PB4 also has the NJTRST pull-up at reset. Firmware sets PWR_CR3.UCPD1_DBDIS first, then drives PB4 low."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 260.35 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
